{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X2CaGlnVmi1794540877.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>昨晚（12日）7時許，將軍澳港鐵站發生一宗男子襲擊職員事件，一名中年男子疑因不滿被查票而發難，突然向一名男職員施襲，造成該名職員口鼻流血受傷。混亂期間，一名到場增援的女職員亦遭該名男子扯頭髮，場面一度混亂。多名在場乘客見義勇為，聯同港鐵職員合力將施襲男子制服。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-13-11h13m00s345.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qBdVTIjQ1i1794540822.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>警方於晚上7時21分接獲報案，指有人於該站C出口一帶遇襲，警員接報趕抵現場後，以涉嫌「襲擊致造成身體傷害」將該名涉案男子拘捕，警方正進一步調查施襲起因。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-13-11h12m53s652.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026I0KXWx9PmX1794540831.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>港鐵事後回覆傳媒查詢，昨晚7時許有職員在站內當值期間，一名男子突然從旁走近施襲，另有兩名同事上前攔阻，各人在過程中先後受傷。港鐵表示，對以暴力對待前線員工的做法予以譴責，並已向受傷同事致以慰問。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-13-11h12m42s324.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026K3nEhR5MbI1794540838.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:35:43.623342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:10.374833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:06.447946+00:00","content_hash":"cc56b0e1e8e80727b42bab9b5e0eb775c013c864b89c176ae6795c0928575cb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}